    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "In Britain this has had a curious result.",
    "translation": "在英国，这种人口结构的转变引发了一个奇特而微妙的结果。",
