    "text": "A century ago Octavia Hill launched the National Trust not to rescue stylish houses but to save the beauty of natural places for everyone \"forever.\"",
    "translation": "一个世纪前，奥克塔维亚·希尔创立了“国民信托”组织，其宗旨并非抢救时尚华美的豪宅，而是为了“永远为所有人守护自然风光之美”。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "主谓宾简单句 + not... but...平行并列不定式目的状语",
      "mainClause": "Octavia Hill launched the National Trust not to rescue stylish houses but to save the beauty of natural places...",
      "modifiers": "A century ago 为时间状语；not to rescue... but to save... 为 not... but... 结构连接两个动词不定式短语作目的状语，强调后者的真正初衷；for everyone forever 为介词短语修饰 save 的受众与期限。",
      "corePattern": "launch sth.（发起/创立某机构或运动）；not to do A but to do B（不是为了做A，而是为了做B）；save the beauty of natural places（保护自然风光之美）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
