    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "The Conservatives' planning reform explicitly gives rural development priority over conservation, even authorizing \"off-plan\" building where local people might object.",
    "translation": "保守党的规划体制改革明确将乡村开发置于生态保护之上，甚至批准在当地居民可能强烈反对的地方实施“计划外”开工建设。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "主谓宾复合句 + 现在分词短语作伴随状语 + where引导的地点状语从句",
      "mainClause": "The Conservatives' planning reform explicitly gives rural development priority over conservation...",
      "modifiers": "explicitly 为副词修饰谓语 gives；gives A priority over B 意为‘把A置于优于B的优先地位’；even authorizing \"off-plan\" building 为现在分词短语作伴随状语表示结果补充；where local people might object 为 where 引导的地点状语从句修饰 building 的发生场所。",
      "corePattern": "give A priority over B（给予A优于B的优先权）；authorize off-plan building（批准未经规划许可的违建/计划外建筑）；object to sth.（反对某事）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
