      "id": "P3-S6",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Only Ukip, sensing its chance, has sided with those pleading for a more considered approach to using green land.",
    "translation": "只有英国独立党（Ukip）敏锐嗅到了政治机遇，站在了那些恳请采取更审慎方式使用绿地的人群一边。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "现在分词短语插入语 + 主谓介宾句 + 现在分词短语作后置定语",
      "mainClause": "Only Ukip has sided with those...",
      "modifiers": "sensing its chance 为现在分词短语作插入状语，说明心理动机；has sided with 为谓语，意为‘站在……一边’；those 为代词作介词宾语；pleading for a more considered approach 为现在分词短语作 those 的后置定语；to using green land 为介词短语修饰 approach。",
      "corePattern": "sense one's chance（察觉到时机/嗅到政治机遇）；side with sb.（站在某人一边/支持某方）；plead for（恳求/呼吁）；a considered approach to doing sth.（对做某事采取深思熟虑的审慎方法）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
