    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P4-S1",
      "pIndex": 4
    },
    "text": "The sensible place to build new houses, factories and offices is where people are, in cities and towns where infrastructure is in place.",
    "translation": "兴建新住房、工厂和办公楼的合理选址应当是人口聚集之地，即在基础设施完备健全的既有城市和城镇之中。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "主系表复合句 + 不定式定语 + where引导的表语从句 + where引导的限制性定语从句",
      "mainClause": "The sensible place is where people are...",
      "modifiers": "to build new houses, factories and offices 为动词不定式短语作主语 place 的后置定语；where people are 为 where 引导的表语从句；in cities and towns 为介词短语作同位语解释；where infrastructure is in place 为 where 引导的定语从句修饰 cities and towns，其中 in place 为固定短语表示‘到位/健全’。",
      "corePattern": "sensible place（明智合理的地方）；where infrastructure is in place（基础设施就位/齐备的区域）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
