  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P4-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P4-S2",
      "pIndex": 4
    },
    "text": "The London agents Stirling Ackroyd recently identified enough sites for half a million houses in the London area alone, with no intrusion on green belt.",
    "translation": "伦敦房地产代理公司斯特林·阿克罗伊德最近确认，仅在伦敦一地就有足够兴建50万套住房的地皮，且完全无需侵犯任何绿化带。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P4-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P4-S3",
      "pIndex": 4
    },
    "text": "What is true of London is even truer of the provinces.",
    "translation": "在伦敦尚且如此，外省各郡县更是有过之而无不及。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P5-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P5-S1",
      "pIndex": 5
    },
    "text": "The idea that \"housing crisis\" equals \"concreted meadows\" is pure lobby talk.",
    "translation": "那种认为“住房危机”就等同于“必须在草地上大铺水泥”的论调，完全是开发商游说集团的一派胡言。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P5-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P5-S2",
      "pIndex": 5
    },
    "text": "The issue is not the need for more houses but, as always, where to put them.",
    "translation": "矛盾的关键不在于是否需要增建住房，而一如既往地在于，究竟把这些房屋建在何处。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P5-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P5-S3",
      "pIndex": 5
    },
    "text": "Under lobby pressure, George Osborne favours rural new-build against urban renovation and renewal. He favours out-of-town shopping sites against high streets.",
    "translation": "在商业游说集团的施压下，财政大臣乔治·奥斯本偏袒乡村新建项目，排斥城市内部的改造与更新；他偏爱城郊购物中心，忽视传统的城市核心商业街区。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "介词短语状语 + 主谓宾复合句 + 对比介词结构（favour A against B）",
      "mainClause": "George Osborne favours rural new-build against urban renovation and renewal.",
      "modifiers": "Under lobby pressure 为介词短语作原因/条件状语；favours 为谓语；rural new-build 为宾语；against urban renovation and renewal 为介词短语表示‘排斥/与……相对立’。",
      "corePattern": "under lobby pressure（在游说团体的施压之下）；favour A against B（偏爱偏袒A而反对B）；renovation and renewal（改造与城市更新）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P5-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P5-S4",
      "pIndex": 5
    },
    "text": "This is not a free market but a biased one.",
    "translation": "这绝非真正的自由市场经济，而是一个充满偏见的扭曲市场。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P5-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P5-S5",
      "pIndex": 5
    },
    "text": "Rural towns and villages have grown and will always grow. They do so best where building sticks to their edges and respects their character.",
    "translation": "乡镇与村落过去在发展，未来也必将持续发展；而当建筑严格恪守在村镇边缘并尊重其原始风貌特色时，它们才能实现最佳的发展。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P5-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P5-S6",
      "pIndex": 5
    },
    "text": "We do not ruin urban conservation areas. Why ruin rural ones?",
    "translation": "我们在城市里绝不会去破坏历史保护街区，为何反倒要去糟蹋乡村保护区呢？",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P6-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P6-S1",
      "pIndex": 6
    },
    "text": "Development should be planned, not let rip.",
    "translation": "经济开发应当受到严格规划管控，而绝非任其野蛮放任发展。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P6-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P6-S2",
      "pIndex": 6
    },
    "text": "After the Netherlands, Britain is Europe's most crowded country. Half a century of town and country planning has enabled it to retain an enviable rural coherence, while still permitting low-density urban living.",
    "translation": "继荷兰之后，英国是全欧洲人口最为稠密的国家；然而半个世纪以来的城乡规划体系，使其在依然允许人们享受低密度城市居住品质的同时，得以保留下令人艳羡的乡村风貌完整性。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "主谓宾补复合句 + 现在分词短语作伴随状语（while still permitting...）",
      "mainClause": "Half a century of town and country planning has enabled it to retain an enviable rural coherence...",
      "modifiers": "Half a century of town and country planning 为名词短语作主语；has enabled 为谓语；it（指代英国）为宾语；to retain an enviable rural coherence 为动词不定式短语作宾语补足语；while still permitting low-density urban living 为省略主谓的时间/伴随状语从句，连接现在分词短语。",
      "corePattern": "enable sb./sth. to do sth.（使某人/某国能够做到某事）；retain an enviable rural coherence（保留令人艳羡的乡村风貌完整协调性）；permit low-density urban living（允许低密度城市居住生活）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P6-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P6-S3",
      "pIndex": 6
    },
    "text": "There is no doubt of the alternative — the corrupted landscapes of southern Portugal, Spain or Ireland.",
    "translation": "若非如此，另一条恶果之路毫无悬念——那便是葡萄牙南部、西班牙或爱尔兰那样满目疮痍、遭到严重破坏的自然地貌景观。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2016_t2.json",
      "year": 2016,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3fa5cd672fd011fd48ea83507dcbb356db157e77d32d974563c6a621f9ab0dd4"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "rebuilt",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2016-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P6-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P6-S4",
      "pIndex": 6
    },
    "text": "Avoiding this rather than promoting it should unite the left and right of the political spectrum.",
    "translation": "避免这种景观浩劫而非推波助澜，本该成为团结整个政坛左翼与右翼力量的共同责任。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
